      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx",
      "issue": "Prop names do not match the DESIGN.md spec (`body` instead of `description`). This could lead to mismatched copy or missed localisation strings. Also the component does not explicitly use the spacing token for its vertical padding.",
